s=slide('The problem and the solution','Describe the assignment scenario, not a claim that the university has already deployed this application. Packages arrive at a perimeter logistics hub. Electric carts and student crews deliver to campus destinations. The project coordinates the handoff and provides package visibility. Carbon savings are an illustrative application feature, not a measured result. Source: assignment section 1 and README.md.')
heading(s,'Why are we building CampusEco?')
text(s,'THE PROBLEM',.8,2.0,5.3,.4,17,'666666',True,0)
text(s,'Campus deliveries need\na coordinated handoff.',.8,2.75,5.35,1.6,29,PURPLE,True,500)
text(s,'Hub staff, drivers, and recipients\nneed to know where each\npackage is in its journey.',.8,4.65,5.3,1.8,22,space=700)
