s=slide('Eco-Transit Crew portal','Crew shift selection links a demo driver ID to a cart and battery report. A cart must have at least 20% battery to claim a new package. The queue is ordered by urgency and destination, not geographic optimization. Claim assigns ownership; only that driver can advance the ordered milestones. Sources: pages/courier.html, Package.claim/advance, Vehicle.reportBattery, crew event handlers. Screenshot: real queue before claim.')
heading(s,'Eco-Transit Crew: assign and deliver','WHAT WE BUILT')
text(s,'Driver + cart + battery report → claimed delivery',.75,1.82,11.8,.65,24)
