text(s,'The assigned driver updates Loaded → En Route → Delivered.',.75,6.55,11.8,.55,23,PURPLE,True,0)

s=slide('Campus End-User portal','Recipients can look up an actual package in the local store, see status and timestamped tracking history, and electronically confirm receipt. A receipt is permitted once after Delivered. The screenshots show the same fictional package used throughout the walkthrough. The receipt screenshot shows a saved confirmation beneath the cleared form. Sources: pages/enduser.html, renderTracking, signoff handler, Package.sign.')
heading(s,'Campus End-User: track and confirm','WHAT WE BUILT')
