s=slide('Recipient features','Explain the other recipient features. Campus registration saves a fictional local name, email, and campus role; it is not a real account. Preferences save a building, room/pickup point, method, notification categories, and instructions. In-app notifications show package events and respect selected categories. Carbon metrics count completed demo deliveries using the disclosed 2 km per package × 0.20 kg CO2 avoided/km assumption. Source: enduser view and renderEnduser. Screenshots: preferences and carbon sections.')
