s=slide('Data storage and current scope','Explain what is real now and what is simulated. localStorage keeps versioned JSON records in the current browser/origin. Hydration restores model methods after refresh; storage events update other portal tabs. sessionStorage holds the tab-specific shift. This is not a database or cross-device service. Demo identities are not authentication. No real emails are sent. The Node development script serves files, not application endpoints. Source: js/app.js, tools/serve.cjs, README.md.')
